  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture on the Mac, with the LOT-001 (#38) kit (`tooling/fixtures/`), the page state: `editprofil.php?config=hfr.inc&page=5` without a working session (logged out or expired cookies)\n\n### Scope\n\nState to capture: `editprofil.php?config=hfr.inc&page=5` without a working session (logged out or expired cookies)\n\nNote: settles what the login flow's page-5 check sees when the new cookies do not work (not captured; until then `LoginFlow` treats a page without a non-empty `hash_check` as `missingHashCheck`, see [LOT-043 (#69) spec](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-043-login.md))\n\nRules: anonymize every free-text field; never hand-build the state in the cloud (LESSONS 36); add a legacy oracle when a parser consumes it (LOT-002 (#39)..005 tooling); one PR per batch of captures; the PR removes the row from the Capture backlog.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-043 (#69)\n\n### Depends on\n\n—\n\n### Owner / session\n\n— (ready; `host: mac`)\n\n### Source\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` \"Capture backlog (Mac)\", copied from the frozen old issue [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#98](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/98).\n",
