   "body": "### Capture result\nCorpus: `R70d` (page 5, stale `md_passs`) and `R71a` (page 5, no cookie); PR #386 (`capture/session-expiry`).\nStale: 200, `.hop` \"Identifiants invalides !\", `Refresh: 1; url=/unlog.php?config=hfr.inc`. No cookie: 200, `.hop` \"Mot de passe incorrect !\", `Refresh: 1; url=../login.php?config=hfr.inc`. Neither sets a cookie, and legacy reports `missingHash` on both (LOT-005 oracles).\nChanges: LOT-043/LOT-044 classification, #383.",
